    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muc ciɛŋä tin wen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Läri jɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, ‘Mucdä, muc mi̱ethdä min waŋkɛ, min tɛɛth lɔcdä, bia jɛ thöp ɣä kɛ gua̱thdɛ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä biɛ la̱r kɛ bä, nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn muc in thöpkɛ kɛ mac min bia thöp Kuoth Nhial, rueeth rɔɔmni da̱ŋ rɛw ti gur kɛli kä thil diw, ala ti waŋkɛ, muc ciɛŋä tin wen bakɛ thöp ciaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi ruath rɔɔmä kɛl thöp kɛ runwaŋ, kä bi min dɔ̱ŋ thöp kɛ thiaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä biɛ thöp kɛɛl kɛ wäl lieeri nuɔ̱p mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ mi ba thöpkɛ ciaŋ, ce̱tkɛ mëë ca kɔn thöp pääm Thi-nay, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa, mi thöp kɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛ mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ruath rɔɔmä min dɔ̱ŋ thöp kɛ thiaŋ. Kä ce̱tnikɛ muc bɛɛl ruɔ̱nwaaŋ, kɛ kɔaŋdɛ, bikɛ thöp kɛ mac, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l in dɔ̱ŋ bi jɛ thöp kɛ thiaŋ kɛɛl kɛ muc bɛɛl kɛ muc kɔŋä ce̱tnikɛ muc ruɔ̱nwaaŋ. Bi jɛ thöp ɛla muc mi waŋkɛ mi la ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muc ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä bi rueeth rɔɔmni da̱ŋ rɛw ti gur kɛli kä thil diw, kɛ rɛw wäli lirä nuɔ̱p mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth, thöp kɛɛl kɛ kɔaŋdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn nɛmɛ ba muc ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋni diaal mi waŋkɛ, gekä mucä min wen in la waŋkɛ kɛnɛ kɔaŋdɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muc path",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ tuk päthniku lap ni Kuoth Nhial a tho̱pi muc in waŋkɛ. Thääk da̱ŋ rɛw, ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl, rueeth rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti gur kɛli kä thil diw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ diɔ̱k wäli nuɔ̱p mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth, ti bi thöp kɛɛl kɛ thäk ɔ. Kɛ rɛw wäli lirä nuɔ̱p mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth biɛ thöp kɛɛl kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi wäl wäli lirä nuɔ̱p mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth thöp kɛɛl kɛ thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l rɔɔmä mɔ. Ala muc mi thöpkɛ kɛ mac ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi thäk kɛl tekɛ liɛɛr kɔŋä, kä bi ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l tekɛ diɔ̱k diɔ̱ɔ̱kni lieeri kɔŋä, kä bi thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l ɔ tekɛ ŋuaan ŋuaani lieeri kɔŋä. Bi nɛmɛ a muc path mi waŋkɛ rɛy päthni runä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl thöp Kuoth Nhial kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä. Ba thöp kɛ gëk mucä ci ciɛŋä min wen in la waŋkɛ kɛnɛ kɔaŋdɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muc ca̱ŋ ŋarä mi thil thuɔp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ cäŋ kä wäl ŋuaan kä pay in jio̱l, ɛ cäŋ bälä Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ cäŋ kä wäl dhieec kä pay ɛ mɔ ɛ cäŋ ŋarä. Kä ba cam ni juray mi thil thuɔp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cäŋ in nhiam ba cäŋ dolä mi rɛl rɔ, /cia bi lät thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö bia Kuoth Nhial thöp muc thi̱n kɛ mac. Bia rueeth thääkni da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl, kɛ thääk deet rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti gur kɛli, ti thil diw thöp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia kɛ thöp kɛɛl kɛ muc nuɔ̱p mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth. Bi diɔ̱ɔ̱k wäli lirä nuɔ̱p thöp kɛɛl kɛ thäk, kɛ rɛw wäli lirä nuɔ̱p thöp kɛɛl kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi wäl wäli thöp kɛɛl kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä, mi luɛli ni rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi kɛn tɔ̱tɔ̱ thöp kɛ gëk mucä ruɔ̱nwaaŋ in waŋkɛ, min la waŋkɛ ni wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛmɔ bi jɛ a tho̱pi ni ciaŋ kɛ ni̱n bärɔw, ala muc mi thöpkɛ kɛ mac, ɛ ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial. Ba thöp kɛ gëk mucä min waŋkɛ kɛnɛ kɔaŋdɛ a wee wä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ bärɔw ni̱ni ba duɔl mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. Thilɛ mi bia la̱t thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muc ca̱ŋ ŋarä ŋër",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ cäŋ in tho̱pi Kuoth Nhial muc bɛɛlku tin nhiam, kɛ cäŋ ŋarä ŋër, ta̱yɛ kɛ duɔl mi rɛl rɔ. Kä /cuarɛ lät thi̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thöpɛ ni Kuoth Nhial muc, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa. Rueeth thääkni da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä, kɛ rueeth rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti gur kɛli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛɛl kɛ nup mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth, diɔ̱ɔ̱k wäli lirä nuɔ̱p kɛɛl kɛ thäk, kɛ rɛw wäli lirä nuɔ̱p kɛɛl kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ wäl wäli nuɔ̱p kɛɛl kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw bikɛ thöp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl mi bi luɛl ni rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikɛ thöp kɛ gëk mucä min waŋkɛ ni ciaŋ, kɛɛl kɛ muc bɛɛl, kɛnɛ kɔaŋ, ala ti thil diw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
